  "content": {
    "id": "p34-q03-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "3",
    "prompt": "Find the coefficient of $x^2$ in $\\left(2x-\\dfrac{3}{x}\\right)^8$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$-48\\,384$\n\nThe general term has power $x^{8-2k}$; set $8-2k=2$, giving $k=3$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\nT_k&=\\binom{8}{k}(2x)^{8-k}\\left(-\\frac{3}{x}\\right)^k\\\\\nT_k&=\\binom{8}{k}2^{8-k}(-3)^k x^{8-2k}.\n\\end{align*}$$\nFor the $x^2$ term,\n$$\\begin{align*}\n8-2k&=2\\\\\nk&=3.\n\\end{align*}$$\nThe coefficient is\n$$\\begin{align*}\n\\binom{8}{3}2^5(-3)^3&=56\\times32\\times(-27)\\\\\n\\binom{8}{3}2^5(-3)^3&=-48\\,384.\n\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
